---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  noindex
  lang="en"
  title="Terms and Conditions - La Mandrágora Restaurant"
  description="Terms and conditions of use, reservations, and services for La Mandrágora Restaurant in Arequipa."
>
  <div class="relative min-h-screen pt-32 pb-24 text-gray-300 overflow-hidden">
    <div
      class="absolute top-20 right-10 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-600/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none z-0"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute bottom-20 left-10 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-600/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none z-0"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-4xl relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h1
          class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-serif text-white tracking-wide mb-4"
        >
          Terms and Conditions
        </h1>
        <p class="text-brand-500 tracking-widest text-xs uppercase">
          Last updated: June 2026
        </p>
        <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-brand-600 mx-auto mt-6"></div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed bg-[#070708]/40 border border-brand-950/10 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-sm backdrop-blur-md"
      >
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white font-serif tracking-wide">
            1. Acceptance of Terms
          </h2>
          <p>
            By accessing and using this website, and when booking a table or
            coordinating services with <strong>La Mandrágora Restaurant</strong
            >, you expressly agree to comply with the terms and conditions
            detailed herein. If you do not agree with any of these rules, we
            kindly ask that you refrain from using our services.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white font-serif tracking-wide">
            2. Reservation Policies
          </h2>
          <p>
            To ensure an exceptional dining experience for all guests and the
            smooth operation of our venue, the following reservation policies
            apply:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-gray-400">
            <li>
              <strong>Grace period:</strong> Reserved tables will be held for a maximum
              grace period of <strong>15 minutes</strong>. After this time, the
              reservation will be automatically cancelled, and the table will be
              released for waiting guests.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Capacity and seating:</strong> Reservations are subject to venue
              capacity on each level (Level 1 or Level 2). While we do our best to
              accommodate your selected floor preference, final table assignments
              depend on table availability and operational logistics.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Modifications and cancellations:</strong> Please inform us at
              least 2 hours in advance if you need to adjust your party size or cancel
              your reservation.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white font-serif tracking-wide">
            3. Venue Access & Age Restrictions
          </h2>
          <p>
            La Mandrágora Restaurant serves alcoholic beverages and hosts live
            musical performances, subject to the following rules:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-gray-400">
            <li>
              The purchase and consumption of alcoholic beverages is strictly
              restricted to individuals 18 years of age or older (a valid ID
              will be required at the bar and upon entry).
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Live shows and evening hours (second floor):</strong> Entry
              to nighttime weekend events on the second floor is exclusively for adults
              (18+).
            </li>
            <li>
              We reserve the right of admission and continued stay within the
              establishment to safeguard the safety and enjoyment of all guests.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white font-serif tracking-wide">
            4. Special Events and Live Performances
          </h2>
          <p>
            Scheduled dates and artists for live shows (bands, DJ sets) are
            subject to change without prior notice due to force majeure or
            technical requirements. We make every effort to maintain an updated
            schedule on our official social media channels and website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white font-serif tracking-wide">
            5. Limitation of Liability
          </h2>
          <p>
            Information displayed on this website (menus, prices, descriptions,
            and images) is for informational purposes. Ingredients and
            availability of dishes and cocktails may vary according to season
            and stock. We strive to keep our menu accurate, but we encourage you
            to confirm daily offerings with your server when ordering.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white font-serif tracking-wide">
            6. Changes to Terms
          </h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to amend or update these terms at any time.
            Continued use of our booking channels following published changes
            will imply acceptance of those updates.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <a
          href="/en/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 border border-brand-600 text-white hover:bg-brand-600/10 transition-all duration-300 rounded-sm text-sm tracking-wider uppercase"
        >
          Back to Home
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
